{
  "id": "HMMT-2007-FEB-GEO-06",
  "task": "solve",
  "source_statement": "[5] Triangle ABC has ∠A = 90◦ , side BC = 25, AB > AC, and area 150. Circle ω is inscribed in ABC, with M its point of tangency on AC. Line BM meets ω a second time at point L. Find the length of segment BL.",
  "clause_ledger": [
